Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:18.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all so peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.74,0:00:20.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's extremely rural, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.91,0:00:21.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.79,0:00:24.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:26.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Has it been that long?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:30.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You haven't been back home once?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.67,0:00:35.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't come home to a place where you've got no family waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.47,0:00:38.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major, you've heard about\Nour general situation, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.22,0:00:41.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.44,0:00:54.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, this is a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.78,0:00:55.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.74,0:00:58.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have honored guests!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.08,0:01:10.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything\Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.84,0:01:15.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything,\Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.14,0:01:20.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's\NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.93,0:01:26.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that\Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.87,0:03:05.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How have you been, Den?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.71,0:03:10.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Grandma Pinako...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.37,0:03:11.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:13.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I need your services again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.71,0:03:17.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.34,0:03:21.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've really done quite a number on yourselves this time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.01,0:03:23.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, a lot has happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.97,0:03:26.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And yet you've gotten so small...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.68,0:03:29.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling small, you Minimum Hag?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.35,0:03:31.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now you've said it, you pipsqueak!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.35,0:03:31.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you bean sprout hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.65,0:03:33.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Micro-pipsqueak!\NFlea-sized hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.31,0:03:35.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward Elric!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.57,0:03:37.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can you speak\Nthat way to your elder?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.07,0:03:41.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I, Armstrong, will remedy this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.53,0:03:45.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.53,0:03:46.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't get the joke, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.37,0:03:49.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alex Louis Armstrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.42,0:03:52.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pinako Rockbell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.96,0:04:00.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.84,0:04:06.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you! Winry!\NAre you trying to kill me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.47,0:04:07.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.51,0:04:09.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the heck did you get so messed up for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.23,0:04:14.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good grief!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.94,0:04:17.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What were you doing to wreck my very best Automail,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.94,0:04:19.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that I put my heart \Nand soul into making?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.28,0:04:21.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, it came apart so easily...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.49,0:04:24.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al's busted up beyond recognition too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.53,0:04:26.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys were up to something dangerous, weren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.74,0:04:29.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.08,0:04:32.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pipsqueak,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.16,0:04:34.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you've grown a little taller,\Nhaven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.58,0:04:35.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to say "pipsqueak"!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.42,0:04:40.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which means, your leg\Nneeds to be adjusted as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.51,0:04:43.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll have to build\Na new arm from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.51,0:04:46.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you manage all that\Nin a week or so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:48.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.77,0:04:53.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me.\NI'll have it done in three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.27,0:04:56.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, Granny!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.23,0:05:00.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what are you \Nin such a rush for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.78,0:05:03.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'd like to get back to Central as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.86,0:05:05.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're looking for\Nsomething important there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.82,0:05:10.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not anything dangerous, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.91,0:05:10.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.04,0:05:13.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not anything like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.54,0:05:16.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jeez,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.83,0:05:19.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you guys never make anything but trouble for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.67,0:05:25.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry may complain, but she's still always there for us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.05,0:05:28.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.18,0:05:37.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It may just be a spare, but there sure is something different about how Granny makes them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.94,0:05:40.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know something,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.23,0:05:43.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,things haven't changed\Naround here, have they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.19,0:05:45.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.62,0:05:53.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Armstrong-san, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.75,0:05:57.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What kind of lives are\Nthose boys living every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.58,0:06:02.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As rural as we are here, we don't get much information about the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.00,0:06:06.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and those boys haven't\Nsent me one letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.72,0:06:09.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I worry about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.60,0:06:17.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Elric brothers—\Nparticularly the Fullmetal Alchemist—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.81,0:06:20.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,are well known around Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.94,0:06:25.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As a result, they do sometimes get drawn into trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.40,0:06:30.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But they are all right.\NThose brothers are strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.99,0:06:33.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Strong, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.95,0:06:35.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Help my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.41,0:06:36.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just bear with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.58,0:06:40.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This pain is nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:51.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have to get back to Central quickly\Nand find that material on the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.89,0:06:55.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's true, but why don't you take it easy for now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.18,0:06:58.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once we go back there,\Nthings are going to be hard, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.69,0:07:03.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe so, but it still bothers me to just sit around doing nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.07,0:07:05.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.49,0:07:08.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go pay a visit to Mom's grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.28,0:07:13.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Visit her grave, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.12,0:07:17.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're leaving as soon as your Automail is fixed, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.50,0:07:19.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So now's the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.87,0:07:21.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.84,0:07:27.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.51,0:07:29.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll be back in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.10,0:07:37.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm finished splitting the firewood,\NMadam Pinako.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.60,0:07:40.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.31,0:07:43.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can take it easy for as long as you're here too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.11,0:07:47.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, as a soldier,\Nmy daily training is essential.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.94,0:07:51.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, I haven't\Nseen Edward around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.07,0:07:54.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He said he was going to visit his mother's grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.83,0:07:59.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told him that going out\Non his own was dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.37,0:08:00.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.25,0:08:03.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He has a first-rate escort\Nalong with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.76,0:08:12.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh? Ed! You're back?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.43,0:08:14.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah! It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.34,0:08:17.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Four or five years, isn't it?\NAnd yet you're still so stunted, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.76,0:08:19.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't call me stunted!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.06,0:08:24.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, are you still working \Nas a State-whatever-it's-called?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.06,0:08:24.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.44,0:08:26.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.23,0:08:27.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're so stunted, and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.69,0:08:29.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop saying I'm stunted!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.74,0:08:40.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?\NYou're just spacing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.29,0:08:44.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm... \NWinry, that girl over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.33,0:08:47.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean Nellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.76,0:08:55.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When we were kids,\Nwe used to play a lot together, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.05,0:08:58.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hide-and-seek,\Nand going down to the river...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.02,0:09:01.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.43,0:09:02.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.10,0:09:07.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just couldn't remember her face...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.57,0:09:12.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure. She's changed\Nquite a bit after all, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.99,0:09:15.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.50,0:09:28.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.25,0:09:33.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's...\Nbring Mom back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:45.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready to go back, Den?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.36,0:09:55.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that one of those watches?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.40,0:09:57.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.99,0:09:59.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It has some workings that boost your power when transmuting—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.78,0:10:01.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.66,0:10:03.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The loving workmanship, the edging...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.16,0:10:05.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is truly the work of a craftsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:08.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you set it?\NDo you wind it by hand?\NOr is it self-winding?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.46,0:10:09.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or could it possibly be—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.38,0:10:11.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Beats me. I've never worried about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:13.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please! Let me examine it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.63,0:10:14.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.59,0:10:16.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I let you have it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.59,0:10:18.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know you're going to take it apart to the very last screw!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.43,0:10:21.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's okay, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.55,0:10:23.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After I analyze it, I'll put it back together the way it was!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.85,0:10:24.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.77,0:10:26.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.52,0:10:27.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get someone else's.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.48,0:10:34.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well now, I think I'll go chop a year's worth of wood...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.19,0:10:38.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bleh! Jeez, you guys are stingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.58,0:10:46.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.50,0:10:51.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Granny says my arm\Nshould be finished tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.33,0:10:53.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once that's done,\Nthe first thing I'll do is fix you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.50,0:10:55.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.80,0:11:02.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, did I ever have any friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.72,0:11:05.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's this, all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.97,0:11:10.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My memory is all hazy.\NI can't remember the faces of any of my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.19,0:11:16.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, you know, your memory is something where, one after another, things pile up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.32,0:11:19.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's only natural that things from the past will fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.32,0:11:21.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.63,0:11:35.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen, Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.51,0:11:39.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.92,0:11:42.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been meaning to say to you for a long time...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.43,0:11:46.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I've been too scared...\Nand I haven't been able to say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.06,0:11:48.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.39,0:11:50.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.89,0:11:52.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.57,0:11:57.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nah... never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.86,0:11:58.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.99,0:12:00.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Young men!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.24,0:12:03.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look at this beautiful night sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.07,0:12:06.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The brilliance of the whole sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.66,0:12:10.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is a blessing from Heaven not visible from the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.12,0:12:16.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a nice place—\Nthis village of Resembool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:21.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To make up for\Nnot having anything,\Nit has many things that the city does not have.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.89,0:12:30.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Long ago, we used to gaze at the stars like this a lot, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.60,0:12:33.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Mm-hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.40,0:12:40.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}And now, the moment you've been waiting for, docking time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.94,0:12:45.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the moment when the nerves connect that gets me each time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.82,0:12:47.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.66,0:12:49.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want to\Nhurry back to Central, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.58,0:12:51.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:55.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like to get\Nmy original body back soon\Nand say goodbye to this pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.29,0:12:58.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's too bad.\NWe make a killing on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.50,0:13:01.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's right. You needn't force yourselves to go back to the way you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.97,0:13:06.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The smell of oil, the creak of the artificial muscles,\Nthe hum of the bearings...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.76,0:13:09.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't Automail wonderful?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.35,0:13:10.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lousy machine fanatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.52,0:13:12.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that, \Nyou transmutation fanatic?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.43,0:13:15.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, here goes. One...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.15,0:13:15.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,two...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.10,0:13:17.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,three!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.07,0:13:24.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two, move aside!\NWe're going to lay Ed down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.24,0:13:33.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had no idea the pain is so great when you attach them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:36.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even a grown man will scream out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.29,0:13:39.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no small matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.13,0:13:44.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.05,0:13:50.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I tried to make the weight of the steel 80% less than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.89,0:13:54.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't have it be so heavy that you don't grow any taller, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.52,0:13:56.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.64,0:14:00.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't go talking about people's heights when they're in such pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.32,0:14:02.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you've still got that much pluck,\Nyou'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.11,0:14:04.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it all working okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.11,0:14:04.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.03,0:14:08.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since it's less heavy,\Nits strength has dropped as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.16,0:14:09.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so make sure you don't do anything reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.41,0:14:14.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can always replace Automail, but you only have one life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.20,0:14:15.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.04,0:14:21.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling a little lightheaded\Nafter working through the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.17,0:14:23.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Winry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.80,0:14:26.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The charge for the rush job\Nwon't be cheap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.89,0:14:29.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.26,0:14:33.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay now, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.14,0:14:34.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yep! Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.72,0:14:36.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's terrific!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.23,0:14:38.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll fix you up right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.27,0:14:42.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These are all the\Nfragments of the armor?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.48,0:14:45.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, the major and the others were careful to pick them all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.61,0:14:50.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll be repaired right away?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.40,0:14:50.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You do have to\Nknow the hang of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.66,0:14:54.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a seal in there, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.87,0:15:00.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That serves as the intermediary\Nbetween Al's soul and the armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.71,0:15:05.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was a close one, huh? If I had been gouged just a little bit deeper...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.30,0:15:08.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter what else happens,\Nthat part has to be safeguarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.42,0:15:11.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the critical area that keeps Al tethered, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.89,0:15:13.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like it was\Ndrawn with blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.81,0:15:16.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's my blood.\NI drew it pretty frantically.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.22,0:15:17.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.27,0:15:19.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What amazing brotherly love!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:21.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Such an incredible bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.85,0:15:24.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could you stand back? You're in my way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.82,0:15:27.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.25,0:15:46.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This feels great!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.34,0:15:48.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.63,0:15:49.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.05,0:15:51.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, should we do the usual?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.93,0:15:52.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The usual?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.97,0:15:53.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.60,0:15:56.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our teacher always told us
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.31,0:16:00.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that in order to train the mind, you must first train the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.10,0:16:02.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al and I always spar\Nwith each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.69,0:16:06.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, I've never ever \Nbeaten him once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.28,0:16:10.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, I will assist you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.19,0:16:11.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.83,0:16:20.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.85,0:16:38.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't get crazy\Nand break it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.23,0:16:42.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good grief...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.64,0:16:46.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're all absorbed in themselves. What a couple of children...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.70,0:16:56.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next up is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.83,0:17:02.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Custom-made articles sure are magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.96,0:17:05.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What polished form!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.50,0:17:07.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What curious workmanship!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.75,0:17:10.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It must be incredible on the inside too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.13,0:17:14.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd sure like to see it!\NI'd sure like to take it apart!\NI'd sure like to put it back together!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.43,0:17:18.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.93,0:17:20.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hee hee...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.06,0:17:23.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.85,0:17:27.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're too soft! You'll never get any further like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.61,0:17:34.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.65,0:17:35.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.62,0:17:41.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.71,0:17:47.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?\NIs that all you've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.69,0:18:11.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.85,0:18:15.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We got him, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:36.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.22,0:18:38.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.05,0:18:41.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.30,0:18:42.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had a look...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.73,0:18:53.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.69,0:18:53.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.\NI'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.82,0:18:56.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For the love of...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.24,0:18:59.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I haven't even shown it to Al.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.95,0:19:00.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:07.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's so sissy of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.87,0:19:10.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,having to carry my\Nadmonition toward myself
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.96,0:19:13.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and my resolve around\Nwith me in this fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.54,0:19:14.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.55,0:19:19.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so,\Nwe don't have any parents,\Nor a house to come home to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.38,0:19:21.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All we can do is move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.89,0:19:25.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?! How come?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.31,0:19:26.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have a home, don't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.06,0:19:30.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have Grandma\Nand me, don't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.98,0:19:35.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's crazy talk.\NWhat are you crying for?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.65,0:19:41.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You brothers won't cry yourselves, so I'm crying for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.04,0:19:52.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where could Ed and\Nthe others have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.79,0:19:57.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, they'll be back here in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.55,0:20:00.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just wait for them like we always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.89,0:20:12.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This was the entrance... and the living room...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.06,0:20:15.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On cold days, we'd put wood in the fireplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.48,0:20:21.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother always skipped\Ncutting the wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.29,0:20:32.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whenever we were\Nlate getting home,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.83,0:20:37.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom would flash a lamp\Nfrom the second-story window.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.63,0:20:43.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was bright, and no matter where\Nwe were playing, once we saw that,\Nwe would hurry home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.55,0:20:45.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to mention it, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.81,0:20:54.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two do have a home, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.85,0:20:57.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A home, with a warm family waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:13.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.96,0:21:14.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.57,0:21:43.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Boys, come on by and\Neat with us once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.70,0:21:46.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure. We will, before long.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.03,0:21:49.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Granny, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.24,0:21:51.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you for looking after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.45,0:21:53.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come back soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.96,0:21:58.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.67,0:22:02.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Grandma...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.63,0:22:07.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I took a look inside Ed's watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.30,0:22:10.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inside, he engraved...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.56,0:22:16.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the date on which they burned down their house and left.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.81,0:23:40.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.56,0:23:43.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 18: "Marcoh's Notes"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.44,0:23:47.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The first branch of\Nthe Central Library...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.69,0:23:51.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From the burnt ashes,\Na handful of truth rises.
